      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "mechanics",
          "statement": "The central loop is short time-trial racing built around repeated attempts to improve personal bests; players consistently describe responsive, easy-to-learn controls paired with a high skill ceiling that rewards learning faster lines and techniques.",
